---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "@/styles/services.css";
---
<BaseLayout title="Service Enquiry Privacy" description="How Porul.in's WhatsApp and email enquiries work, what to share and how to contact us about your enquiry information.">
  <div class="service-page"><header class="service-intro"><div class="wrap"><h1>Service enquiry privacy.</h1><p>Updated <time datetime="2026-09-24">24 September 2026</time>.</p></div></header><div class="wrap">
    <section class="service-band"><h2>Preparing a message</h2><p>The enquiry form prepares a message in your browser. It does not submit your fields to a Porul server or save them in browser storage. Opening WhatsApp transfers the prepared text to WhatsApp in the link URL; it may appear in your browser history. Opening your email app transfers the prepared message to that app. You decide whether to send it. Copying uses your device's clipboard.</p></section>
    <section class="service-band"><h2>When you use WhatsApp</h2><p>Messages you send reach Porul's business WhatsApp number, +91 89393 57690. We use your message and contact details to review the requirement and communicate about the work. WhatsApp processes information under its own terms and privacy policy. No WhatsApp widget or tracking script is loaded on this website.</p></section>
    <section class="service-band"><h2>When you email us</h2><p>Your email address and whatever you include reach the hello@porul.in mailbox. We use that information to understand your request, assess whether we can help, prepare a quote and communicate about the work. The Porul team and the person handling your assignment, including Shreepriya for GeM work, may need to review it.</p><p>Send business contact details and a short description initially. Do not send passwords, OTPs, DSC PINs, Aadhaar copies or bank records. Documents for an agreed assignment are discussed separately.</p></section>
    <section class="service-band"><h2>Questions or deletion requests</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@porul.in?subject=Enquiry%20privacy%20request">hello@porul.in</a> to ask about, correct or request deletion of your enquiry information. Any records that must be retained for an agreed engagement will be explained in response.</p><p>Your email provider and our hosting and email providers also process data under their own policies. This notice describes the service enquiry flow; it does not claim that visiting a hosted website produces no technical logs.</p></section>
  </div></div>
</BaseLayout>
